Docker image: `{{ release.image }}:{{ release.version }}`

## Install

Requires Docker Engine and Docker Compose. Run on a host with port 8080 free; configuration is stored in the `acmeproxy-config` volume.

```sh
curl -fLO {{ download }}/{{ folder }}.tar.gz
curl -fLO {{ download }}/SHA256SUMS
sha256sum --ignore-missing --check SHA256SUMS
tar -xzf {{ folder }}.tar.gz
cd {{ folder }}
docker compose up -d --wait
docker compose exec acmeproxy cat /config/admin.token
```

Stop if checksum verification fails. Open http://127.0.0.1:8080 and sign in with the displayed token.

